### Batch 6.4 — Custom 404

**Build:** `src/pages/404.astro` with suggestions (link to search, popular posts, sitemap). Configure Cloudflare Workers `not_found_handling: "404-page"` in `wrangler.jsonc` ([Astro Cloudflare deploy troubleshooting](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/deploy/cloudflare/)).

**Acceptance tests:** navigating to `/does-not-exist` returns a 404 status with the custom page body.

