**Goal:** Taste-layer touches. Cut this entirely if scope tightens.

### Batch 7.1 — Custom cursor

**Build:** Hand-rolled (~50 LOC) Svelte component using `pointermove` + `requestAnimationFrame` + lerp; shows on `:hover` of `[data-cursor]` anchors. Respect `pointer: fine` media query (no cursor on touch) and `prefers-reduced-motion`.

**Why hand-roll:** `kursor` and `custom-cursor-react` are small projects with sporadic updates; the code is genuinely ~50 lines. Same advice as several custom-cursor explainers: use raw pointer events.

**Acceptance tests:** cursor follows pointer at 60 fps; disabled on touch devices; disabled when `prefers-reduced-motion`.

